{"en": "1326252042", "title": "🚀 Untuk tim implementasi", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "localId": "74635c1575ca"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Untuk tim implementasi"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "165f8545b6c5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tim implementasi adalah pihak yang menerapkan OpenELIS Global di laboratorium atau situs baru, atau di laboratorium kesehatan masyarakat atau laboratorium rujukan tingkat nasional. Mereka merencanakan, memasang, mengonfigurasi, mengintegrasikan, melatih, dan menyerahterimakan perangkat lunak."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "69f971589d8d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Untuk siapa halaman ini"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f8c644a3703e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Anda menyiapkan OpenELIS Global di tempat yang belum pernah menggunakannya. Hal ini mencakup segala hal, mulai dari uji coba di satu laboratorium hingga peluncuran nasional di banyak situs. Pekerjaan Anda meliputi pengadaan perangkat keras, pemasangan server, penyiapan jaringan, konfigurasi khusus (katalog pemeriksaan, kamus, peran pengguna, integrasi), migrasi data jika ada, dan pelatihan pengguna akhir. Sebagian besar isi bagian ini tidak bergantung pada negara; halaman implementasi negara (Madagaskar, Ethiopia, Indonesia) adalah contoh referensi."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "24efb05ae3b0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Alur kerja tim implementasi"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "1320a29b96db"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. Perencanaan"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "a339dfb894fc", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "19826b1b3f5e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9f481544a84e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Praktik terbaik implementasi", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239927340"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": faktor yang membuat implementasi berhasil (keterlibatan pimpinan, pelatihan, dukungan teknis, penerapan). Mulailah dari sini."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "172bade04f98"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "09359e95b888"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Persyaratan teknis server dan komputer kerja", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239632412"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": kebutuhan perangkat keras, jaringan, UPS, dan infrastruktur. Gunakan untuk pengadaan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "aafab864b1b7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2. Pemasangan"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "2d1f237f3278", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "b0366b9fef9e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "75779e2eabd2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Memasang OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239632402"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Ubuntu 22.04, Docker, sertifikat, skrip instalasi."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e38d085f2913"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cde9ab5a1e5f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Alat analisis (analyzer)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239829012"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": plugin antarmuka alat analisis, cara menghubungkan instrumen."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7095f47fc295"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "111ff180eecc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jika memperbarui instalasi yang sudah ada: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Memperbarui OpenELIS 3.x dan 2.x", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239730698"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Memperbarui dari 2.x ke 2.7", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239697942"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "f2a299550794"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3. Konfigurasi sesuai konteks Anda"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "1801542fd0ee", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ad685c80e60e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "eb0ea891e2ef"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration Initializer", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/234487814"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": memuat katalog pemeriksaan, kamus, dokter pengirim, dan lainnya dari file data, alih-alih mengeklik satu per satu di UI admin."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e9238421c2e7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "23cb09b0fa49"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mengonfigurasi file properti untuk Consolidated Server", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/240058394"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": jika Anda terhubung ke server agregasi pusat."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e265648db808"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f0d7f15adfc2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cara menerjemahkan OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/713162758"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": lokalisasi melalui Transifex jika Anda merilis dalam bahasa baru."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "57969734540a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4. Integrasi"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "13339661b430", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7128e55b1363"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7971fb21dcfe"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Penyiapan Single Sign On", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/235175938"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Keycloak / SAML / OAuth2 jika diperlukan."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "23c23c48d96f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "252c865a5b6a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Integrasi OpenMRS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/682852353"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": menghubungkan OE ke EMR OpenMRS untuk pemesanan pemeriksaan yang masuk."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "eb43d81d3561"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5e104e591d0b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Integrasi OpenELIS: Odoo", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": integrasi inventaris / peralatan / pemeliharaan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "058561f9e69a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "5. Pelatihan dan serah terima"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "562543807227"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Arahkan pengguna akhir Anda ke bagian "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Untuk petugas laboratorium", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326972929"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Tim implementasi Madagaskar menyusun paket serah terima pada Mei 2026 yang berguna sebagai templat; mintalah salinannya kepada tim OpenELIS Global."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "9d569b9eb477"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Contoh implementasi di negara"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d91563c03dcb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Penerapan nyata yang dapat Anda jadikan referensi:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "acc0452c946c"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2dbabccf1cf1"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c8ee4493114a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Madagaskar", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1159069707"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7a82192a572f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c3c93c83337e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "AHRI: Ethiopia", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1160183814"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "137474f5ed53"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bfe2eb1f4f08"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SILNAS: Indonesia", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1159593995"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "1344f95d2867"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tempat mendapatkan bantuan"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "eec78f71f5cc"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "eaf98a333e37"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "63bc411dfd7d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "talk.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": forum diskusi utama. Tim implementasi dari penerapan lain aktif di sana."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "da5256ce8e09"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f96865e8e950"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2 GitHub", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": laporkan issue jika Anda menemukan bug saat pemasangan."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6e6673693e9b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d10912619de8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Masalah operasional setelah peluncuran", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": lihat bagian "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Untuk operator", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325793288"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b32ac93e26c7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tetap mutakhir"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "565831a2571b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pantau halaman "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rilis", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326219273"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " agar mendapat pemberitahuan saat versi baru dirilis; hal ini penting untuk merencanakan jadwal pembaruan versi (upgrade) Anda. Pantau juga halaman implementasi negara yang sesuai dengan konteks Anda jika Anda mengikuti penerapan referensi tertentu."}]}], "version": 1}}